{
  "fol": "∀s ((MachineBasedSystem(s) ∧ ∃a (Autonomy(a) ∧ OperatesWithVaryingLevelsOf(s, a)) ∧ ∃d (Deployment(d) ∧ ExhibitsAdaptivenessAfter(s, d)) ∧ ∃o ((ExplicitObjective(o) ∨ ImplicitObjective(o)) ∧ IntendedPurpose(o) ∧ HasObjective(s, o)) ∧ ∃i (Input(i) ∧ Receives(s, i) ∧ InfersFrom(s, i)) ∧ ∃out (Output(out) ∧ Generates(s, out) ∧ (IsOutputType(out, p) ∨ IsOutputType(out, c) ∨ IsOutputType(out, r) ∨ IsOutputType(out, dec)) ∧ ∃e ((PhysicalEnvironment(e) ∨ VirtualEnvironment(e)) ∧ Environment(e) ∧ CanInfluence(out, e)))) ⇒ AISystem(s))"
